  {
   "id": "caput-mortum-341136@1.2.1.0",
   "gameId": "caput-mortum-341136",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2.1.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-19T17:17:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Here comes a small patch addressing a few things that were brought up to us:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a confirmation prompt in the main menu when you try to start a new game while already having a save file active.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated Spanish LATAM localization.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the number on the 7th door in the waterways.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the enemy's behavior bug that would sometimes make them stand still, doing nothing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a check when picking up items to avoid related bugs when interacting and picking up things very quickly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Apologies if this patch took a while. We've been busy making progress on the demo for our next title, Fright Train! It's an action survival horror game, like RE4, and we think people are going to have a blast playing it. ːsteamhappyː I'll make sure to post an announcement here once the demo is live!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also have a couple of Caput Mortum sticker packs left in our store, so go grab one if you like!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you, and let us know if you have questions or if you encounter any issues with the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gab,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "WildArts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
